<section name="Setting the Icon View">

The first time, you should set:

<ul>
<li>The Icon View: just type <i>CMD + i</i></li>
<li>The size of the Window to show all the applications available: pull down and right side the window border to resize it as your taste.</li> 
</ul>

That's done: the next time, Launcher will remember your taste.
  
</section>
